{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45679","headline":"上杜使君 · 贯休","name":"上杜使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲鱼须处海，爲木须在岳。\n一登君子堂，顿觉心寥廓。\n右听青女镜，左听宣尼铎。\n政术似蒲卢，诗情出冲漠。\n从来苦清苦，近更加澹薄。\n讼庭何所有，一只两只鹤。\n烟霞色拥墙，禾黍香侵郭。\n严霜与美雨，皆从二天落。\n苍生苦疮痍，如何尽消削。\n圣君新雨露，更作谁恩渥。\n即捉五色笔，密勿金銮角。\n即同房杜手，把乾坤橐龠。\n休说卜圭峰，开门对林壑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}